sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (UI)
    participant C as Client (BlazorWeb / MauiApp)
    participant DB as SQLite (Local)
    participant B as SyncBackgroundWorker
    participant API as SysVet API
    participant CDB as Cloud DB (SQL Server / SQLite dev)

    U->>C: Create/Edit Tutor or Pet
    C->>DB: Save entity plus OutboxMessage same transaction
    DB-->>C: Saved Locally
    C-->>U: Success (No Network Required)

    loop Every ~30s or connectivity restored
        B->>B: SetSyncing true when online
        B->>DB: Read pending OutboxMessages FIFO batch up to 50
        alt Is Online
            B->>API: HTTP POST sync push
            API->>CDB: PushSyncBatchCommand MediatR idempotent
            CDB-->>API: ProcessedIds or FailedMessageId
            API-->>B: SyncPushResult
            B->>DB: ProcessedAt or Error or NextRetryAt
            B->>API: HTTP GET sync pull since cursor
            API-->>B: tutors pets tombstones
            B->>DB: Upsert SuppressOutbox advance SyncState
        else Is Offline
            B-->>B: Wait next cycle retain locally
        end
        B->>B: SetSyncing false
    end
